# Governance, proof and dev tooling — never ship in the published artifact.
# .brandmap.json and BRANDING.md necessarily CONTAIN the forbidden terms (they
# are the rule), tests/ is the proof harness, and neither is of any use to an
# installed extension. Shipping them also made the VSIX brand scan unpassable
# by construction.
